{"4656800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Yani Again", "steam_appid": 4656800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Yani Again</i></strong> is a high-speed action game. Shift between reality and cyberspace, explore dangerous tracks hidden across the world, and overcome every challenge at extreme speed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High-Speed Rush</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/a9af93a5a0847cf1a501f44a6fab7fe3.poster.avif?t=1779259520\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/a9af93a5a0847cf1a501f44a6fab7fe3.webm?t=1779259520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/a9af93a5a0847cf1a501f44a6fab7fe3.mp4?t=1779259520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain your momentum and race through dangerous routes at blazing speed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Split-Second Decisions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/06cf0b2339b86b299c068012b83597d4.poster.avif?t=1779259520\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/06cf0b2339b86b299c068012b83597d4.webm?t=1779259520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/06cf0b2339b86b299c068012b83597d4.mp4?t=1779259520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every skill has only one charge. Precise timing and clever usage are the key to survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Between Two Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/32cb57cc4b9d839bb2efa65f63583c9d.poster.avif?t=1779259520\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/32cb57cc4b9d839bb2efa65f63583c9d.webm?t=1779259520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/32cb57cc4b9d839bb2efa65f63583c9d.mp4?t=1779259520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between reality and cyberspace, discover unknown paths, and uncover hidden shortcuts and the truth behind the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pursue Perfection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/0a825d173a2da4e34c0574463e46fe5b.poster.avif?t=1779259520\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/0a825d173a2da4e34c0574463e46fe5b.webm?t=1779259520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/0a825d173a2da4e34c0574463e46fe5b.mp4?t=1779259520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your routes and execution, complete challenges as fast as possible, earn medals, and share your records.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’m the solo gamemaker liujiajun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ve always loved creating unique and interesting gameplay mechanics, and experimenting with strange new ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my 9th game released on Steam, and I hope you enjoy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’m also excited to see players discover new routes, techniques, and speedrun strategies together, and gradually build a community around the game.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Yani Again</i></strong> is a high-speed action game. Shift between reality and cyberspace, explore dangerous tracks hidden across the world, and overcome every challenge at extreme speed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High-Speed Rush</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/a9af93a5a0847cf1a501f44a6fab7fe3.poster.avif?t=1779259520\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/a9af93a5a0847cf1a501f44a6fab7fe3.webm?t=1779259520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/a9af93a5a0847cf1a501f44a6fab7fe3.mp4?t=1779259520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain your momentum and race through dangerous routes at blazing speed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Split-Second Decisions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/06cf0b2339b86b299c068012b83597d4.poster.avif?t=1779259520\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/06cf0b2339b86b299c068012b83597d4.webm?t=1779259520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/06cf0b2339b86b299c068012b83597d4.mp4?t=1779259520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every skill has only one charge. Precise timing and clever usage are the key to survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Between Two Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/32cb57cc4b9d839bb2efa65f63583c9d.poster.avif?t=1779259520\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/32cb57cc4b9d839bb2efa65f63583c9d.webm?t=1779259520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/32cb57cc4b9d839bb2efa65f63583c9d.mp4?t=1779259520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between reality and cyberspace, discover unknown paths, and uncover hidden shortcuts and the truth behind the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pursue Perfection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/0a825d173a2da4e34c0574463e46fe5b.poster.avif?t=1779259520\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/0a825d173a2da4e34c0574463e46fe5b.webm?t=1779259520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4656800/extras/0a825d173a2da4e34c0574463e46fe5b.mp4?t=1779259520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your routes and execution, complete challenges as fast as possible, earn medals, and share your records.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Deve